WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.934
-Welcome, everybody.

00:00:01.934 --> 00:00:03.669
Thank you. Thank you.
Thank you so much.

00:00:03.669 --> 00:00:05.004
Welcome to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:06.939
Let's get to the news
and some jokes here.

00:00:06.939 --> 00:00:09.976
Well, guys, the Trump campaign's
efforts to flip the election

00:00:09.976 --> 00:00:12.111
in court are not going well.

00:00:12.111 --> 00:00:13.613
Out of more than 30 lawsuits,

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:16.182
at least 24 have already
been dismissed.

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:18.451
And this weekend, even
Chris Christie jumped ship.

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:19.719
Listen to what he said.

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:22.422 line:0%
-If you've got the evidence of
fraud, present it.

00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:25.124 line:0%
And what's happened here is,
quite frankly,

00:00:25.124 --> 00:00:26.960 line:0%
the conduct of the
president's legal team

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:29.161 line:0%
has been
a national embarrassment.

00:00:29.161 --> 00:00:31.898
-Yep, Chris Christie called
Trump's legal team

00:00:31.898 --> 00:00:33.900
"a national embarrassment."

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.501
Meanwhile, people in
foreign countries were like,

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:37.837
"Actually,
it's embarrassing here, too."

00:00:40.173 --> 00:00:41.574
When Trump heard what Christie
said, he was like,

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:42.609
"You know what?

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:43.777
Ever since I gave you COVID,

00:00:43.777 --> 00:00:47.947
you've been a real
pain in the butt."

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:50.516
Of course, Trump's not happy
with his legal team.

00:00:50.516 --> 00:00:51.917
He just removed one lawyer

00:00:51.917 --> 00:00:54.153
who was spreading some pretty
crazy conspiracy theories.

00:00:54.153 --> 00:00:55.421
Watch this.

00:00:55.421 --> 00:00:57.891 line:0%
-The Trump campaign's trying to
distance itself

00:00:57.891 --> 00:01:00.259 line:0%
from controversial attorney
Sidney Powell.

00:01:00.259 --> 00:01:03.763 line:0%
Powell is among those pushing a
convoluted conspiracy theory

00:01:03.763 --> 00:01:06.966 line:0%
claiming an international plot
involving, in part,

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:09.902 line:0%
a dead dictator
led to stolen votes.

00:01:09.902 --> 00:01:12.938
-Yeah. She got kicked off
Trump's legal team

00:01:12.938 --> 00:01:15.641
for being too crazy.

00:01:15.641 --> 00:01:17.376
That's like getting kicked off
of "Real Housewives"

00:01:17.376 --> 00:01:20.179
for being too crazy.

00:01:20.179 --> 00:01:22.182
Seriously, you know how nuts
you have to be when

00:01:22.182 --> 00:01:23.849
Rudy Giuliani's
head starts leaking,

00:01:23.849 --> 00:01:27.387
and you're the one
who gets fired?

00:01:27.387 --> 00:01:29.188
For anyone asking what's
more embarrassing than

00:01:29.188 --> 00:01:31.257
being on the Trump legal team,
the answer is

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:34.193
getting fired from
the Trump legal team.

00:01:34.193 --> 00:01:36.229
It's not easy to fire a
conspiracy theorist either.

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:37.863
I mean, when you say,
"We have to let you go,"

00:01:37.863 --> 00:01:39.199
they're like, "Right.

00:01:39.199 --> 00:01:40.900
I get it.

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:43.570
I'll just go then.

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:50.609
I'll 'clean out my office.'"

00:01:50.609 --> 00:01:52.779
That's right -- Sidney Powell
is out after she said

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:56.782
the election was stolen by
Venezuelan dictator Hugo Chávez,

00:01:56.782 --> 00:01:59.285
who died seven years ago.

00:02:00.987 --> 00:02:03.622
Yep, her conspiracy theories
were too much even for Trump.

00:02:03.622 --> 00:02:05.758
Well, today,
she wrote a farewell e-mail.

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:06.893
It said...

00:02:32.018 --> 00:02:35.154
I don't know.

00:02:35.154 --> 00:02:37.557
Meanwhile, I saw that, today,
First Lady Melania Trump

00:02:37.557 --> 00:02:39.658
received The White House
Christmas tree.

00:02:39.658 --> 00:02:40.827
Here's a photo.

00:02:40.827 --> 00:02:41.828
With a big, warm smile,

00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:44.564
Melania accepted
the tree and said...

00:02:47.266 --> 00:02:49.969
There you go.

00:02:49.969 --> 00:02:51.337
Meanwhile, Sidney Powell
was like,

00:02:51.337 --> 00:02:52.438
"Don't let that tree inside.

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:55.908
It's a Venezuelan transmitter."

00:02:55.908 --> 00:02:58.344
Speaking of the holidays,
Thanksgiving is almost here,

00:02:58.344 --> 00:03:00.747
and a lot of people are
traveling, believe it or not,

00:03:00.747 --> 00:03:01.848
despite the risks.

00:03:01.848 --> 00:03:03.182
Watch this.

00:03:03.182 --> 00:03:06.018 line:0%
-On Thursday, the CDC
recommended against traveling

00:03:06.018 --> 00:03:07.486 line:0%
and gathering for Thanksgiving.

00:03:07.486 --> 00:03:09.421
-And, according to TSA,
over the past three days,

00:03:09.421 --> 00:03:12.558
more than 3 million people
packed the nation's airports,

00:03:12.558 --> 00:03:14.894
ignoring the CDC's advice.

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:16.362
-What are people doing?

00:03:16.362 --> 00:03:18.498
3 million Americans are going to
show up for Thanksgiving like,

00:03:18.498 --> 00:03:22.301
"I brought some yams
or maybe the plague."

00:03:22.301 --> 00:03:23.702
If you're going to travel
this week,

00:03:23.702 --> 00:03:26.406
at least do the decent thing
by sealing yourself in a box

00:03:26.406 --> 00:03:28.874
and letting FedEx ship you home.

00:03:28.874 --> 00:03:31.077
It can't be comforting when
you're at a crowded airport

00:03:31.077 --> 00:03:35.214
watching CNN talk about how dumb
it is to be at an airport.

00:03:35.214 --> 00:03:36.416
You know it's
a bad idea when even

00:03:36.416 --> 00:03:39.319
airport sushi
thinks you're disgusting.

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:42.956
And that's not all.

00:03:42.956 --> 00:03:46.659
The CDC is also warning against
traveling on cruise ships.

00:03:46.659 --> 00:03:48.695
They just raised
the risk level to Level 4,

00:03:48.695 --> 00:03:51.063
which is as high as it goes.

00:03:51.063 --> 00:03:53.433
To put that into perspective,
after it hit the iceberg,

00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:56.402
the Titanic was at Level 3.

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:58.237
Even people who flew
this weekend are like,

00:03:58.237 --> 00:04:01.107
"Those cruise guys are idiots."

00:04:01.107 --> 00:04:03.042
And interesting --
a recent poll found that

00:04:03.042 --> 00:04:07.246
nearly 60% of Americans would
get a coronavirus vaccine.

00:04:07.246 --> 00:04:08.915
It's pretty interesting poll.
Take a look at this.

00:04:08.915 --> 00:04:12.085
60% said...

00:04:12.085 --> 00:04:14.987
30% said...

00:04:14.987 --> 00:04:16.022
10% said...

00:04:19.225 --> 00:04:22.595
40% said...

00:04:22.595 --> 00:04:23.696
15% said...

00:04:26.966 --> 00:04:28.034
82% said...

00:04:31.971 --> 00:04:33.006
40% said...

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:38.444
73% said...

00:04:45.752 --> 00:04:46.853
24% said...

00:04:52.425 --> 00:04:53.660
80% said...

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:58.698
40% said...

00:05:03.702 --> 00:05:05.004
Finally, 40% said...

00:05:07.407 --> 00:05:09.475
And that, of course,
is the latest installment

00:05:09.475 --> 00:05:11.644
of our segment
"Interesting Polls."

00:05:11.644 --> 00:05:15.648
♪♪

00:05:15.648 --> 00:05:17.183
Hey, this is nice here at
30 Rock.

00:05:17.183 --> 00:05:18.918
The skating rink is now open,

00:05:18.918 --> 00:05:20.153
but you've got to wear a mask,

00:05:20.153 --> 00:05:23.189
and your time on the ice
is limited to 50 minutes.

00:05:23.189 --> 00:05:25.290
There aren't a lot of tourists
in New York City right now.

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:27.326
This morning, it was just
a hot-dog guy and cabby

00:05:27.326 --> 00:05:30.763
doing a three-minute pairs
program to "Endless Love."

00:05:30.763 --> 00:05:32.398
Yeah, this raised
an interesting question.

00:05:32.398 --> 00:05:33.932
If the rink is open
but no one's there

00:05:33.932 --> 00:05:37.503
to watch tourists fall down,
is it really open?

00:05:37.503 --> 00:05:38.737
Here's some business news.

00:05:38.737 --> 00:05:41.907
I saw that Guitar Center
just filed for bankruptcy.

00:05:41.907 --> 00:05:43.843
Today, Guitar Center
thanked their employees

00:05:43.843 --> 00:05:46.078
and all the liars who said
they spent quarantine

00:05:46.078 --> 00:05:48.647
learning a new instrument.

00:05:48.647 --> 00:05:49.982
This is actually
a pretty big deal,

00:05:49.982 --> 00:05:51.083
'cause now if Brookstone closes,

00:05:51.083 --> 00:05:52.384
we're going to be out of places

00:05:52.384 --> 00:05:55.754
where you can kill 45 minutes
without buying anything.

00:05:55.754 --> 00:05:56.855
Here's a local story.

00:05:56.855 --> 00:05:58.223
Over the weekend,
the police busted

00:05:58.223 --> 00:05:59.925
a big gathering in Queens.

00:05:59.925 --> 00:06:01.293
Check out what it was.

00:06:01.293 --> 00:06:04.364 line:0%
-In Queens, police broke up a
private swingers party.

00:06:04.364 --> 00:06:06.965 line:0%
Officers responded to
Club Caligula

00:06:06.965 --> 00:06:08.801 line:0%
on 20th Avenue in Astoria

00:06:08.801 --> 00:06:10.602 line:0%
shortly after midnight
yesterday.

00:06:10.602 --> 00:06:13.139 line:0%
At least 80 people
were inside the club.

00:06:13.139 --> 00:06:15.908
-Now we know what
"King of Queens"

00:06:15.908 --> 00:06:18.910
would have been like
if it aired on Cinemax.

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:20.045
It was a crazy scene.

00:06:20.045 --> 00:06:21.881
One officer walked
in and yelled, "Freeze!",

00:06:21.881 --> 00:06:24.584
while another yelled, "Cheryl?!"

00:06:28.754 --> 00:06:30.623
And, finally, in Canada,

00:06:30.623 --> 00:06:33.759
officials had to put up
road signs warning drivers

00:06:33.759 --> 00:06:36.262
not to let the moose
lick their cars.

00:06:36.262 --> 00:06:39.565
This is real. Look at this.

00:06:39.565 --> 00:06:41.067
It was weird for drivers
who only saw

00:06:41.067 --> 00:06:42.267
the second part of that message.

00:06:42.267 --> 00:06:45.771
They're like, "Lick my car?
Okay."

00:06:45.771 --> 00:06:48.307
Yeah, apparently, it's been
a tough time for the moose

00:06:48.307 --> 00:06:51.043
since officials broke up their
underground swingers club.

00:06:51.043 --> 00:06:54.646
Hey, everyone. It is Monday.
We're so excited to be back.

00:06:54.646 --> 00:06:57.349
We have an amazing week
of shows ahead.

00:06:57.349 --> 00:06:59.251
Melissa McCarthy will be here!

00:06:59.251 --> 00:07:00.553
