00:07:24.476 --> 00:07:27.345
So tune in Thanksgiving night.
Set your DVRs.

00:07:27.345 --> 00:07:29.015
Set your Betamax machine.

00:07:29.015 --> 00:07:33.719
Set your TiVos, your DiVos,
